Column name: util_practice_desc Type: STRING Description: Utilizations (e.g., GRAIN, FROZEN, SLAUGHTER) or marketing channels (e.g., FRESH MARKET, PROCESSING, RETAIL).
Column name: statisticcat_desc Type: STRING Description: The aspect of a commodity being measured (e.g., AREA HARVESTED, PRICE RECEIVED, INVENTORY, SALES).
Column name: unit_desc Type: STRING Description: The unit associated with the statistic category (e.g., ACRES, $ / LB, HEAD, $, OPERATIONS).
Column name: short_desc Type: STRING Description: A concatenation of six columns: commodity_desc, class_desc, prodn_practice_desc, util_practice_desc, statisticcat_desc, and unit_desc.
Column name: domain_desc Type: STRING Description: Generally another characteristic of operations that produce a particular commodity (e.g., ECONOMIC CLASS, AREA OPERATED, NAICS CLASSIFICATION, SALES). For chemical usage data, the domain describes the type of chemical applied to the commodity. The domain = TOTAL will have no further breakouts; i.e., the data value pertains completely to the short_desc.
Column name: domaincat_desc Type: STRING Description: Categories or partitions within a domain (e.g., under domain = SALES, domain categories include $1,000 TO $9,999, $10,000 TO $19,999, etc).
Column name: agg_level_desc Type: STRING Description: Aggregation level or geographic granularity of the data (e.g., STATE, AG DISTRICT, COUNTY, REGION, ZIP CODE).
Column name: state_ansi Type: INT64 Description: American National Standards Institute (ANSI) standard 2-digit state codes.
Column name: state_fips_code Type: INT64 Description: NASS 2-digit state codes; include 99 and 98 for US TOTAL and OTHER STATES, respectively; otherwise match ANSI codes.
Column name: state_alpha Type: STRING Description: State abbreviation, 2-character alpha code.
Column name: state_name Type: STRING Description: State full name.
Column name: asd_code Type: INT64 Description: NASS defined county groups, unique within a state, 2-digit ag statistics district code.
Column name: asd_desc Type: STRING Description: Ag statistics district name.
Column name: county_ansi Type: INT64 Description: ANSI standard 3-digit county codes.
Column name: county_code Type: INT64 Description: NASS 3-digit county codes; includes 998 for OTHER (COMBINED) COUNTIES and Alaska county codes; otherwise match ANSI codes.
Column name: county_name Type: STRING Description: County name.
Column name: region_desc Type: STRING Description: NASS defined geographic entities not readily defined by other standard geographic levels. A region can be a less than a state (SUB-STATE) or a group of states (MULTI-STATE), and may be specific to a commodity.
Column name: zip_5 Type: INT64 Description: US Postal Service 5-digit zip code.
Column name: watershed_code Type: INT64 Description: US Geological Survey (USGS) 8-digit Hydrologic Unit Code (HUC) for watersheds.
Column name: watershed_desc Type: STRING Description: Name assigned to the HUC.
Column name: congr_district_code Type: INT64 Description: US Congressional District 2-digit code.
Column name: country_code Type: INT64 Description: US Census Bureau, Foreign Trade Division 4-digit country code, as of April, 2007.
Column name: country_name Type: STRING Description: Country name.
Column name: location_desc Type: STRING Description: Full description for the location dimension.
Column name: year Type: INT64 Description: The numeric year of the data.
Column name: freq_desc Type: STRING Description: Length of time covered (ANNUAL, SEASON, MONTHLY, WEEKLY, POINT IN TIME). MONTHLY often covers more than one month. POINT IN TIME is as of a particular day.
Column name: begin_code Type: INT64 Description: If applicable, a 2-digit code corresponding to the beginning of the reference period (e.g., for freq_desc = MONTHLY, begin_code ranges from 01 (January) to 12 (December)).
Column name: end_code Type: INT64 Description: If applicable, a 2-digit code corresponding to the end of the reference period (e.g., the reference period of JAN THRU MAR will have begin_code = 01 and end_code = 03).
Column name: reference_period_desc Type: STRING Description: The specific time frame, within a freq_desc.
Column name: week_ending Type: DATE Description: Week ending date, used when freq_desc = WEEKLY.
Column name: load_time Type: TIMESTAMP Description: Date and time indicating when record was inserted into Quick Stats database.
Column name: value Type: FLOAT64 Description: Published data value.
Column name: value_suppression_code Type: STRING Description: Any suppression codes used to avoid displaying data that should not be disclosed or from putting out data lower than the precision level defined by NASS. Code definitions can be found in the NASS publications.
Column name: cv_percent Type: FLOAT64 Description: Coefficient of variation. Available for the 2012 Census of Agriculture only. County-level CVs are generalized.
Column name: cv_suppression_code Type: STRING Description: Any suppression codes used to avoid displaying data that should not be disclosed or from putting out data lower than the precision level defined by NASS. Code definitions can be found in the NASS publications.
